es > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Suspension and Steering', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820lp-mnmwe0va8xz5c1', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1636686904%2F23399443087', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
